# Lab 4 planning ignores Lab 3

Lab 4 is a greenfield project. It shares the Git repository at
`lasalle-web-services` with Lab 3. Shared history is not a design source.

When planning Lab 4, including `/speckit-plan` and the artifacts it writes
(`plan.md`, `research.md`, `data-model.md`, `contracts/`, `quickstart.md`):

- Use the Lab 4 constitution, the feature spec, and files under `lab-4/` only.
- Do not read, cite, or copy Lab 3 code, tests, schema, config, or docs.
- Do not treat `lab-3/` paths, commits, or diffs as existing project conventions.

```text
# Use
lab-4/.specify/memory/constitution.md
lab-4/specs/<feature>/spec.md

# Do not use
lab-3/src/**
lab-3/tests/**
lab-3/README.md
lab-3/pyproject.toml
```
